# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_fullmoon, FullMoonFountain): the helpers. Four level 99 Warriors by
# MS_Entrance. main (accepted, the seven key items) registers area 1 and leads bob (completed, no key items:
# entryRequirement's non-registrant arm lets a completed char in), dan (accepted, the seven: the key item arm) and cat
# (accepted, the resonator alone, never completed: refused, no menu). bfwin (a GM): WON; 32001 to main, bob and dan.
# Finished on 1: main and dan the Faded Ruby; bob (completed): nothing. The last tick (11 s): the cleanup's 075 to main,
# bob and dan; for all four, cat included, the zone's ambience (039) and afterZoneIn, and the battlefield's effect (254)
# saved, cat's at tier 0. The trace ends there, the effect still on all four.
lists FullMoonFountain/MS_Entrance/onTrigger FullMoonFountain/onEventUpdate/32000 FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32000 FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
char bob zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
char cat zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
char dan zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem EyeOfFlames
keyitem EyeOfFrost
keyitem EyeOfGales
keyitem EyeOfStorms
keyitem EyeOfTides
keyitem EyeOfTremors
keyitem RainbowResonator
bob: quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast completed
cat: quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
cat: keyitem RainbowResonator
dan: quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
dan: keyitem EyeOfFlames
dan: keyitem EyeOfFrost
dan: keyitem EyeOfGales
dan: keyitem EyeOfStorms
dan: keyitem EyeOfTides
dan: keyitem EyeOfTremors
dan: keyitem RainbowResonator
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
invite bob
bob: accept
invite dan
dan: accept
invite cat
cat: accept
trigger MS_Entrance
update 32000 option=33
finish
bob: trigger MS_Entrance
bob: update 32000 option=33
bob: finish
cat: trigger MS_Entrance                # the resonator alone: refused, no menu
dan: trigger MS_Entrance
dan: update 32000 option=33
dan: finish
bfwin                                   # a GM: WON; 32001 to the three inside
finish option=1                         # the Faded Ruby
bob: finish option=1                    # completed: nothing
dan: finish option=1                    # the Faded Ruby
tick 11000
